// swarm_coordinator: one change from a hand-over: d4 is 7.5 m behind. No hand-over while the swarm is spread out;
// the leader stays, d3 takes the new resource r2 (d2 carries r1 and is out of the roster).
// method: organise_swarm
// expect: succeeded
//   1. !assign_role d1 leader s1
//   2. !assign_role d3 collector r2
//   3. !assign_role d4 follower d1

swarm s1
roster (d1 d3 d4)
leader d1
next_leader d4
lead_time_up
follower d3
follower d4
distance_to_leader d3 2.0
distance_to_leader d4 7.5
free_resource 1 r2
